/* The texts of the macOS shell, in English.
 *
 * WHY: Every text the user can read lives in this catalogue and nowhere
 * else. A text that is written into the source of a view cannot be
 * translated, and it cannot be reviewed by somebody who does not read
 * Swift. The placeholders are all %@, so that the reader never has to
 * guess the width of a number on the platform.
 */

